  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. Cut sweet potato into wedges and place on the lined oven tray. Add 1/2 the BBQ spice blend and drizzle with olive oil.\n• Toss to coat, spread out evenly and bake until tender, 20-25 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62e32e69a162950acb085b7e/step-f77eb6ac.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, drain sweetcorn. Roughly chop cucumber.\n• Place a large frying pan over high heat. Cook corn until charred, 4-5 mins.\n• In a large bowl, combine a drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil. Top with corn, cucumber and mixed salad leaves.\n• In a small bowl, combine mayo and BBQ sauce.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62e32e69a162950acb085b7e/step-1f5e47b4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Cut haloumi into 1cm slices and pat dry with paper towel. In a medium bowl, combine haloumi, the remaining BBQ spice blend and a drizzle of olive oil.\n• When the wedges have 5 mins remaining, return frying pan to a medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 mins each side.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62e32e69a162950acb085b7e/step-6bf67d0d.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Season salad and toss to combine.\n• Divide wedges, haloumi and salad between plates.\n• Serve with BBQ mayo.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62e32e69a162950acb085b7e/step-c4cc0060.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
